554 0 obj
<</Alt(Diagram of the OPH fixed-point loop. A central screen cell with detuning P is read in two ways: outward as a geometric displacement P minus phi, and inward as an electromagnetic endpoint width root pi times root alpha. The two readings are tied together in a closure equation P equals phi plus root pi over root inverse alpha, which fixes the value of the fine-structure constant near 137.036.)/K[ 0 2]/P 553 0 R /Pg 158 0 R /S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
